WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
10:00 — Large-text wealth. Raza opens wealth on his iPhone at large text — retirement holdings readable without asking his daughter to translate pixels.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
15:00 — Daughter on iPad. Together on the iPad they review the portfolio; she can see it without taking the paper file away.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
19:00 — Dividend history. Dividend history on the laptop replaces a drawer of statements; informational, not advisory.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
19:45 — Announcements. Announcements on the laptop stay informational — he reads, he does not get hustled into a product.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
20:10 — Phone goodnight. Phone locks. Holdings stay visible. Pride stays quiet.

